# Trivy ignore list (read by `trivy fs` at the repo root).
#
# DS-0002 (HIGH): "run containers as a non-root USER".
# Acknowledged, not yet enforced, because a correct fix is an infra change:
#   - backend-node AND ai-python share a root-owned named volume
#     (uploads_volume -> /tmp/strategor-uploads); dropping to non-root breaks
#     writes on already-provisioned volumes unless UIDs are aligned and the
#     volume is chown'd.
#   - the frontend nginx image needs root to bind :80; going non-root means
#     migrating to port 8080 across the Dockerfile, docker-compose and the
#     system reverse proxy (nginx/nginx.conf).
# Tracked as a dedicated hardening task to be done and redeploy-tested on its own.
AVD-DS-0002
DS-0002
